OL,3,GNEWSAI will be last man standing, says
OL,4,ARaac home owner refusing to sell
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is nearly three years since
OL,7,Fpotentially dangerous concrete was
OL,8,Fidentified in the roofs of hundreds of
OL,9,Fhomes in Aberdeen.
OL,11,FMore than 500 properties - most of them
OL,12,Fcouncil-owned - were found to contain
OL,13,Freinforced autoclaved aerated concrete
OL,14,F(Raac) back in late 2023.
OL,16,FWork to demolish many of the properties
OL,17,Fstarted last month, but a handful of
OL,18,Fowners - who have rejected offers from
OL,19,Fthe city council to buy their home -
OL,20,Fremain.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
