OL,3,GNEWSAI will be last man standing, says
OL,4,ARaac home owner refusing to sell
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmong them is Raymond Smith, 40, who
OL,7,Ftold BBC Scotland News: "This is a
OL,8,Ffamily home. I will be the last man
OL,9,Fstanding."
